{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（23日）清晨6時22分，警方接獲一名男子報案，聲稱在紅磡崇平街土瓜灣基本污水處理廠對開跳海。救援人員到場在岸邊發現遺書，亦發現事主在岸邊抱住欄杆，隨即落水將他男子。</p><p>男事主神智清醒，被送上岸在救護車上接受檢查。警方正調查其身份及蹈海原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"人員在海面救起男事主。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179328963785527296564209.jpeg/-mGR7xpZ-Ok7xPPLwK8cowWhHqIa1sHJZdhl6mXYZeo\"/><figcaption>人員在海面救起男事主。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179328959972773888721958.jpeg/mWkyrvON0IS4Ghkw4JEy2CLX388BQZuaJ01mxSdNZsU\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男子報稱在土瓜灣基本污水處理廠對開跳海。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179328956411678720026478.jpeg/rehmSip9mTAfPf2SIge3JJptu406JA64Xrh1D164dQ8\"/><figcaption>男子報稱在土瓜灣基本污水處理廠對開跳海。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男子獲救後送院。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179331875286552576526841.jpeg/UgXy3o23y_Z85Kupx1TvRD20igCWgBlnbwFqFW8BahU\"/><figcaption>男子獲救後送院。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男子獲救後送院。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179331877534830592408153.jpeg/3s_l-M7V9ytMXZYAr-MMrxGbWFcosLHtrrDgTK6w4Ew\"/><figcaption>男子獲救後送院。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T23:38:35.049206+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}